			<TRAN name="obcsb_oimf_491r" title="보안카드발급상세조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="83" _ulen="63" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_PWD^계좌비밀번호^68^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="331" _ulen="247" >

SCRC_SRNO^보안카드일련번호^16^0^7^0^0^0^0
ISNC_TMNU^발급 횟수^4^0^7^0^0^0^0
SCRC_ISNC_DATE^보안카드 발급 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
UTLZ_REG_DATE^이용 등록 일자^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
APRV_YN^승인 여부^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
SCRC_STAT_CODE^보안카드 상태 코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
